lName":"Rep. Luttrell, Morgan [R-TX-8]","party":"R","state":"TX"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-02-05","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Specialist Joey Lenz Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Department of Defense (DOD) to ensure that periodic health assessments of members of the Armed Forces include specified elements. DOD must ensure that annual assessments include a sports physical, an&nbsp;electrocardiogram, and specified blood work. Other periodic assessments must include certain testing related to burn pit exposure,&nbsp;perfluoroalkyl and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) exposure, and other tests or evaluations determined to be appropriate by DOD.</p>","updateDate":"2025-04-30T14:50:17Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Specialist Joey Lenz Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-17T23:39:24Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-17T23:39:24Z"}
